## Verdict

GreenOnion is the **best compliance-first AI listing tool we've tested**. The 60-second flow holds up across all 3 platforms, and the policy-aware approach saves significant time vs. manual policy lookup. The downside is no scoring system, so you don't get feedback on how *good* your listing is, just whether it's compliant.

For multi-platform sellers and Amazon newbies, GreenOnion is worth the [PENDING: pricing] investment. For conversion-focused sellers, Picjam is the better pick.

The 60-second compliance flow is a genuine innovation. The lack of scoring means you'll need to pair GreenOnion with a scoring tool (like Picjam) for full optimization coverage.

